### Obtener todos los alumnos
GET http://localhost:3000/alumnos


### Crear alumno
POST http://localhost:3000/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Juan Perez",
    "notas": [8, 7, 9]
}


### Crear otro alumno
POST http://localhost:3000/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Maria Lopez",
    "notas": [5, 6, 4]
}


### Crear alumno promocionado
POST http://localhost:3000/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Pedro Gomez",
    "notas": [9, 10, 8]
}


### Consultar un alumno
GET http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Juan%20Perez


### Consultar otro alumno
GET http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Maria%20Lopez


### Modificar alumno
PUT http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Juan%20Perez
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Juan Perez",
    "notas": [10, 9, 8]
}


### Intentar crear alumno con nombre repetido
POST http://localhost:3000/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Juan Perez",
    "notas": [6, 6, 6]
}


### Eliminar alumno
DELETE http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Maria%20Lopez


### Consultar alumno inexistente
GET http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Carlos%20Gomezs